Musts:
- 65% layout from keyboard-layout.png

Wants:
- Bluetooth LE (5.1?)
- ~1200MaH battery
- Hotswap switch mounts

Antenna:
- Tiny patch antenna
- TI inverted F intenna schematic

SOC:
- https://www.nordicsemi.com/Products/nRF52840
- https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/nordic-semiconductor-asa/NRF52840-QFAA-F-R/15929812
  - 4823-NRF52840-QFAA-F-RCT-ND

misc:
- Phil's Lab:
  - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nkHFoxe0mrU
  - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PlXd3lLZ4vc
- REMEMBER PCB GUIDELINES FROM NRF DATASHEET PAGE 967
- Look at crystal datasheet for cap values
- Use shielded inductors to prevent RF interference

